verse_key":"23:69"}]},{"verse_key":"23:70","surah":23,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ بِهِۦ جِنَّةٌۢ ۚ بَلْ جَآءَهُم بِٱلْحَقِّ وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ لِلْحَقِّ كَـٰرِهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Why do they say he is possessed? He has brought them the truth and most of them hate it,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"In him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جِنَّةٌۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) madness","transliteration":"jinnatun","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَآءَهُم","en_gloss":"he brought them","transliteration":"jāahum","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"but most of them","transliteration":"wa-aktharuhum","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"to the truth","transliteration":"lil'ḥaqqi","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَـٰرِهُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) averse","transliteration":"kārihūna","verse_key":"23:70"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٧٠","en_gloss":"(70)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"23:70"}]},{"verse_key":"23:71","surah":23,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوِ ٱتَّبَعَ ٱلْحَقُّ أَهْوَآءَهُمْ لَفَسَدَتِ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ وَٱلْأَرْضُ وَمَن فِيهِنَّ ۚ بَلْ أَتَيْنَـٰهُم بِذِكْرِهِمْ فَهُمْ عَن ذِكْرِهِم مُّعْرِضُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but if the truth were in accordance with their desires, the heavens, the earth, and everyone in them would disintegrate. We have brought them their Reminder and they turn away from it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوِ","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"walawi","verse_key":"23:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱتَّبَعَ","en_gloss":"(had) followed","transliteration":"ittabaʿa","verse_key":"23:71"